=head2 wrap

  $dom = $dom->wrap('<div></div>');
  $dom = $dom->wrap(Mojo::DOM->new);

Wrap HTML/XML fragment around this node (for all node types other than C<root>), placing it as the last child of the
first innermost element.

  # "<p>123<b>Test</b></p>"
