  my $text = $dom->all_text;

Extract text content from all descendant nodes of this element. For HTML documents C<script> and C<style> elements are
excluded.

  # "foo\nbarbaz\n"
  $dom->parse("<div>foo\n<p>bar</p>baz\n</div>")->at('div')->all_text;

=head2 ancestors

