=head2 max_line_size

  my $size = $headers->max_line_size;
  $headers = $headers->max_line_size(1024);

Maximum header line size in bytes, defaults to the value of the C<MOJO_MAX_LINE_SIZE> environment variable or C<8192>
(8KiB).

=head2 max_lines

