  Mojo::IOLoop->start unless Mojo::IOLoop->is_running;

=head2 delete_p

  my $promise = $ua->delete_p('http://example.com');

Same as L</"delete">, but performs all requests non-blocking and returns a L<Mojo::Promise> object instead of accepting
