=head2 get_p

  my $promise = $ua->get_p('http://example.com');

Same as L</"get">, but performs all requests non-blocking and returns a L<Mojo::Promise> object instead of accepting a
callback.

  $ua->get_p('http://example.com' => json => {a => 'b'})->then(sub ($tx) {
